+**Scale/Scope**: Two files — `plugins/graphhelm/hooks/session_hook.py` (one line of header construction in `_end_impl`) and `plugins/graphhelm/hooks/test_session_hook.py` (extended assertions in the end-request contract test, plus the retry test if it observes headers); no other file touched
